          </li>
          <li id="ref-2">
            <strong>2.</strong> International Society for Clinical Densitometry (ISCD). <em lang="en">2023 ISCD Official Positions – Adult</em>. <a href="https://iscd.org/official-positions-2023/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Resmî pozisyon metni</a>
          </li>
